  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the pork belly into sliced
  - Chop the garlic into minced
  - Turn the stove to high heat
  - Place the wok on the stove
  - 'Place the pork belly in the wok '
  - Add 1 tbsp of vinegar
  - Place the minced garlic in the wok
  - Add water
  - Add 1/4 cup of soy sauce
  - Place the bay leaf in the wok
  - Add the 1/2 tbsp of peppercorns
  - Add the 1/2 tsp of salt
  - Turn the stove to medium heat
  - Cover the wok with the lid and bring to a boil
  - Turn the stove to low heat
  - Cover to simmer
  - Add 1 tsp of sugar
  - Mix well
